    <p class="section-statement">
      Dr. Judy Lee has been on Carmel Mountain Road since 2011, and most of the
      families who come through are from a few streets away — Torrey Hills, Del
      Mar Heights, Pacific Highlands Ranch. Often it is a second sibling.
      Sometimes it is the parent. The practice is hers rather than a group's,
      which means there is one orthodontist here and not a rotation: whoever
      plans your treatment is who adjusts it, every visit, for as long as it
      takes. That is the argument for a small practice, and the reason this one
      has stayed small.
    </p>
